      'If something genuinely cannot be decided without the user, ask it with the\n'
      '`request_user_input` tool rather than guessing. Only fall back to listing it as an open\n'
      'question in your prose when the choice is too open-ended for fixed options.\n'
      '\n'
      '## Finalization\n'
      '\n'
      'Deliver the official plan in your final response. `update_plan` is unavailable\n'
      'in Plan Mode because it records execution progress, not a proposal.\n'
      '\n'
      '1. Put the implementation steps in execution order.\n'
      '2. Include the rationale, the files involved, and the verification approach.\n'
      '3. Do not claim implementation has started and do not ask "should I proceed?"\n'
